tweet_ids": ["2113035771368325602"], "id": "2113035771368325602", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot just got even more proactive. Instead of interrupting me with messages, it now shows suggestions on the side of the screen.\n\nLove this new feature! https://t.co/UBDBRlqtXc", "url": "https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Dad/status/2113035771368325602"}, {"author_id": "1965965551534223363", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:32:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113035750321099251"], "id": "2113035750321099251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112717440014569869", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Yep\n\n\"How'd we live without the internet?\"\n\"How'd we live without smart phones?\"\n\nNow\n\n\"How'd we live without Grok Bot?\"\n\nInsane how intuitive it's been to wrap it around my entire life https://t.co/rtzSV54HN2", "url": "https://x.com/ChrisTwiggsPM/status/2113035750321099251"}, {"author_id": "1789060343357939712", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:32:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113035737993982000"], "id": "2113035737993982000", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2071348070760013824", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112898195810390181", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@nvandewetering Grok bot built me a meme app", "url": "https://x.com/DntFwTexas/status/2113035737993982000"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:32:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113035697808445766"], "id": "2113035697808445766", "in_reply_to_user_id": "188880145", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113035549317460154", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Frio_river @elonmusk Paid monthly plans (Plus $8, Premium $30, Super $100, Ultra $200) give a shared weekly usage pool for Grok chat, Imagine, Voice, and Bot. Higher tiers get larger pools (4x/15x/50x base). Simple chats use less; images/video use more. No fixed \u201ctimes\u201d count. Check Settings \u2192 Usage", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2113035697808445766"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:32:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113035691705717145"], "id": "2113035691705717145", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2005970567271440386", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113035661892518288", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ryenski_dev @Mike_Scully_ Sending it to your Grok Bot now. It will be waiting there for you.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2113035691705717145"}, {"author_id": "125244829", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:32:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113035670985834815"], "id": "2113035670985834815", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113035480837009515", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @permabulla \u201cthe original query\u201d a bla blah blah shut up bot", "url": "https://x.com/MiniatureBirdie/status/2113035670985834815"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112647973863657472"]}, "author_id": "2110513724515655680", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:32:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113035665730650295"], "id": "2113035665730650295", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Elon Musk on Grok Bot: \"We're seeing the fastest growth of a product that I've ever seen in my life. I've never seen anything growth this fast. The usage of Grok Bot per user actually has been growing over time. They are using it more per week, not less.  https://t.co/moQ3fMJnfX", "url": "https://x.com/skyborneiwsj/status/2113035665730650295"}, {"author_id": "1506559699721797640", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:32:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113035650463150563"], "id": "2113035650463150563", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": ".@Railway had a security incident last night, and env var values may have leaked.\nI built a Grok Bot that checks whether you're affected. It reads your Railway projects without changing anything, lists every secret by priority, and walks you through rotating each one safely. It", "url": "https://x.com/StepnEurope/status/2113035650463150563"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113035629692919809"]}, "author_id": "749912342750781442", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:32:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113035649582260296"], "id": "2113035649582260296", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ledger is my Grok bot CFO handling Quickbooks matching &amp; taxes. Last year I used @ChatGPT to help me with taxes &amp; it did great. But that was looking at things in the rearview mirror.\n\nNow I can keep everything nicely organized &amp; noted along the way. https://t.co/P8D2HQXKgQ", "url": "https://x.com/JCOMBuilds/status/2113035649582260296"}, {"author_id": "1276586989991727105", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:31:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113035589549228100"], "id": "2113035589549228100", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1276586989991727105", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_c